>P.S. Does anyone know *exactly* how the scores are calculated?

I'm not sure about hack, but in NetHack the scoring goes something like this:

	(50 * max. dungeon level) + (value in zorkmids of gold/gems/etc.) +
	(4 * Xp gotten by slaying monsters)

10% of your gold is taken by whomever finds your carcass, if you die.
Experience points acquired by eating wraiths, etc., doesn't count toward your
score.
